{
  "title": "Transit Gateway · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "여러 VPC와 온프레미스 네트워크를 허브처럼 연결한다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Transit Gateway</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#attachments\">Attachments</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#route-table-association\">Route Table Association</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#route-propagation\">Route Propagation</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#static-and-blackhole-routes\">Static and Blackhole Routes</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#inter-region-peering\">Inter-Region Peering</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#aws-ram-sharing\">AWS RAM Sharing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#appliance-mode\">Appliance Mode</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>56 / 62</span></div><h1>Transit Gateway</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 7 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Transit Gateway는 여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>와 On-premises Network를 연결하는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 단위 Transit Hub다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a>의 비전이성을 해결하고 중앙 Route 관리와 Network 분리에 활용한다.</p><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a>과 Transit Gateway <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a>은 별개의 경로 계층이다. 연결된 Attachment가 어떤 Table을 사용하고 어느 Table에 경로를 알리는지 설계해야 한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Hub 연결과 Routing 격리\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Hub 연결과 Routing 격리</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Connectivity</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN</a> attachments</strong><small>지원 연결을 Hub에 연결</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Transit Gateway</strong><small>중앙 Routing</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Destination attachment</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> 결과에 따라 전달</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Segmentation</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Production attachments</strong><small>관련 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a>에 Association</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Propagation rules</strong><small>학습할 Route 범위 설정</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Isolation</strong><small>Dev·Prod 간 도달성 제어</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Attachment를 만들었다고 모든 연결이 자동으로 서로 통신하도록 설계해야 하는 것은 아니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"attachments\"><h2>Attachments<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#attachments\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#direct-connect-gateway\">Direct Connect Gateway</a>, Peering, Connect 등의 연결이 Attachment다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/#vpc-attachment\">VPC Attachment</a>에서 선택한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 Subnet과 경로가 중요하다. Hub에 붙였다는 이유만으로 모든 연결 간 통신을 허용하는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"route-table-association\"><h2>Route Table Association<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#route-table-association\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Attachment는 연결된 Transit Gateway <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a>을 조회해 다음 경로를 선택한다. 운영·개발 Network를 서로 다른 Table에 연결하면 격리할 수 있다. 한 Attachment의 조회 Table과 경로를 전파하는 Table을 구분한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"route-propagation\"><h2>Route Propagation<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#route-propagation\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Attachment의 경로를 지정한 Table에 자동으로 알리는 기능이다. 여러 Table로 전파할 수 있지만 Association은 조회할 Table을 정한다. 잘못된 Propagation은 예상하지 않은 Network 접근을 만들 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"static-and-blackhole-routes\"><h2>Static and Blackhole Routes<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#static-and-blackhole-routes\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>정적 Route로 대상 Attachment를 명시하거나 Blackhole Route로 특정 주소 범위를 버릴 수 있다. AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>가 자동으로 필요한 모든 정적 Route를 만드는 것은 아니다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> 쪽 Return Route도 함께 구성한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"inter-region-peering\"><h2>Inter-Region Peering<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#inter-region-peering\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>의 Transit Gateway와 Peering Attachment를 만들 수 있다. 관련 Route를 명시적으로 구성해야 하며 자동 전파 지원을 무조건 가정하지 않는다. 글로벌 Network는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>별 Hub와 경로 정책을 함께 운영한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"aws-ram-sharing\"><h2>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> RAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Resource Access Manager)</span> Sharing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#aws-ram-sharing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Transit Gateway를 여러 계정에 공유해 Network Hub를 중앙 관리할 수 있다. 계정별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> 소유와 Hub 운영 권한이 분리된다. 공유했다고 모든 계정 리소스 권한이 자동으로 부여되지는 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"appliance-mode\"><h2>Appliance Mode<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#appliance-mode\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Stateful Inspection Appliance를 경유하는 구성에서 흐름의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 경로 일관성을 유지하는 데 사용한다. 비대칭 Route는 Firewall의 연결 상태와 충돌할 수 있다. Inspection <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>와 Return Path를 같이 설계한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>여러 계정의 운영 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>는 서로 연결하되 개발 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>와는 격리하려면 별도 Transit Gateway <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a>과 제한된 Propagation을 구성한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>연결만 생성하면 모든 트래픽이 자동 허용되는 것은 아니다. 라우팅과 보안을 구성한다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/tgw/what-is-transit-gateway.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">vpc/latest/tgw/what-is-transit-gateway.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q019/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q019\" data-question=\"Q019\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q019</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q019/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">VPC A is peered with VPC B, and VPC B is peered with VPC C. Can A reach C through B using these peering connections?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q019\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if A&#x27;s security group allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q019\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">No. VPC peering does not support transitive routing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q019\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if B has a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q019\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, by default</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">피어링</a>은 비전이적이다. 별도 연결이나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>를 설계한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q020\" data-question=\"Q020\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q020</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q020/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants a central hub to connect dozens of VPCs and on-premises networks. Which service is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q020\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q020\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q020\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SNS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q020\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>가 다수 네트워크의 중앙 연결과 라우팅에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN / Direct Connect</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q094\" data-question=\"Q094\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q094</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q094/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">One VPC uses 10.0.0.0/16 and a VPC it must connect to uses 10.0.1.0/24. What prevents VPC peering between them?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q094\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The presence of route tables</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q094\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The CIDR ranges overlap</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q094\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The VPCs are in different AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q094\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Each VPC has an ENI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · 겹치는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">피어링</a> 연결에 사용할 수 없다. 주소 계획부터 바꿔야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q022\" data-question=\"Q022\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q022</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q022/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to quickly establish an encrypted tunnel between its on-premises network and AWS over the internet. Which service should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q022\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudFormation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q022\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q022\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Site-to-Site VPN</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q022\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#site-to-site-vpn\">Site-to-Site VPN</a>이 IPsec 터널을 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN / Direct Connect</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q008\" data-question=\"Q008\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q008</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q008/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A route table has 10.0.0.0/16 to a peering connection and 10.0.1.0/24 to a local target. Which principle determines the route for 10.0.1.25?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Shortest prefix match</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The route created first</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compare only the last octet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Longest prefix match</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 목적지 전체 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>을 비교해 더 구체적인 일치 경로를 우선한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">이전 용어 <b>Subnet / CIDR</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">다음 용어 <b>VPC</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
